text = "[center]- [pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff99 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]Addiction Report[/color][/pulse] -

I gotta do something [color=#ff8864]quick[/color], 'cause it's a fact: [color=#ff1c18]I'm way too hooked[/color], and in this state, I won't [color=#ff1c18]make it much longer[/color].

And thinking about how I ended up in this [color=#ff8864]mess[/color]... it's [color=#ff8864]not[/color] gonna [color=#ff1c18]fix[/color] [color=#ff8864]anything[/color]...

Hell, I can barely [color=#ff8864]think straight[/color] right now."
