In this [color=#ff8864]job[/color], the [color=#ff1c18]key[/color] thing is supposed to be [color=#ff1c18]keeping cool[/color].

But, well... That's not really [color=#ff8864]happening[/color] [color=#ff1c18]right now[/color]. Every time I think I've got a [color=#ff8864]grip on things[/color], I just [color=#ff8864]loose it again[/color]!

Guess we all know by now that [color=#ff8864]keeping your nerves under control[/color] is just a [color=#ff8864]myth[/color]."
