text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0]The  [color=#ff1c18]addiction  crisis[/color]  storm  has  [color=#ff8864]passed[/color],  but the  [color=#ff1c18]threat[/color]  [color=#ff8864]lingers[/color].[/pulse]

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0]The  [color=#ff8864]price[/color]  for  this  [color=#ff8864]momentary  peace[/color] was  [color=#ff1c18]high[/color].[/shake]

The  [color=#ff8864]weight  of  the  struggle[/color]  has  etched [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]deep[/color]  [color=#ff1c18]marks[/color][/shake],  the  [color=#ff8864]calm[/color]  is  [color=#ff1c18]fragile[/color]  and  the [color=#ff8864]horizon[/color]  is  still  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff1c18]dark[/color][/shake].

