text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]Financial[/color]  [color=#ff8864]mastermind[/color]![/pulse]

Wow. [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Five  unpaid  bills[/color][/shake]?  
That's  a  really  impressive  dedication to [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff1c18]self-sabotage[/color][/shake].

Apparently, [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]ignoring[/color][/shake]  debt  collectors doesn't  make them  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]disappear[/color][/shake].  
So  now  you  get  to  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]meditate[/color][/shake]  on  your life  choices...
...in  a  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff1c18]cell[/color][/shake],  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]for the  next[/color] [color=#ff1c18]3 days[/color][/shake].[/center]
"

